                <td style="width: 224.547px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Endophytic mass involving the lateral nasal wall or sinuses</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 253px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Significant (~5%-15%) risk of synchronous or metachronous squamous cell carcinoma. The role of HPV in malignant transformation remains debated.</td>
