                <td style="width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CIN or cancer</td>
                <td style="width: 121px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16, 18 (major); 31, 33, 45, and others</td>
                <td style="width: 98.4531px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">HR</td>
                <td style="width: 224.547px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Precursor lesions (CIN 1-3), invasive cervical cancer</td>
                <td style="width: 253px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">HR of progression from high-grade CIN (CIN 2/3) to invasive cancer if untreated. HPV causes &#x0003e;99% of cervical cancers.</td>
